// Test: break.error-break-own-label
function main() returns ExitCode
	while true 'loop'
		break 'loop'
	end 'loop'
	return 0
end 'main'
---
CompilerError:
error E2048: <fragment>:4:9: 'break' with label 'loop' targets its own loop; use 'break' without a label, or 'break' with the label of an outer loop
